Error [jet.ContractUsesEffect]: A `#Pre` condition can't do I/O
  --> tests/ui/contract_reads_computed_field.jet:16:11
    |
 16 | #Pre(pair.label != "", "labeled") show_label: fn(pair: Pair) { print(pair.label) }
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: A contract is checked at every call and must be a pure claim about values
 Fix: Move the effect out; keep only a pure test
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0139
